<title>USA: University of Delaware weighs rate increases.</title>
<headline>University of Delaware weighs rate increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, Del. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>University of Delaware on Tuesday will consider a plan to raise charges for room and board.</p>
<p>The Board of Trustees is set to meet at 1500 EDT to discuss the idea, as well as consider elections for new officers.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
